{"id":"15016c1e1dd46781","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Level Of Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree — ZFC Tree8 Level Of Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree — ZFC Tree8 Level Of Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree — ZFC Tree8 Level Of Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R,\\alpha,L\\in V\">\\(T,R,\\alpha,L\\in V\\)</span> (tree carrier, reflexive tree order, level ordinal, and candidate level)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\)</span> (tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (bijection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\}\">\\(P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\}\\)</span> (strict predecessor set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}level\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,R,\\alpha,L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\nL=\\Bigl\\{t\\in T:\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P_t,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P_t\\;\\bigl(\nx\\neq y\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\n\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in f(y)\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}level\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,R,\\alpha,L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\nL=\\Bigl\\{t\\in T:\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P_t,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P_t\\;\\bigl(\nx\\neq y\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\n\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in f(y)\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A node lies on level <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> exactly when the strict part of its reflexive predecessor order is isomorphic to the membership order on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The order-isomorphism is expanded explicitly, so the definition does not rely on an unregistered <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otp}\">\\(\\operatorname{otp}\\)</span> accessor.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)$ (tree predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,A,B)$ (bijection predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,R,\\alpha,L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}level\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,R,\\alpha,L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\nL=\\Bigl\\{t\\in T:\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P_t,\\alpha)\\\\\n&\\hspace{37mm}\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P_t\\;\\bigl(\nx\\neq y\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\n\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in f(y)\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otp}","display":false}],"bytes":1690,"backli